In VMS, a DECterm just shows up as a VT300_SERIES with REGIS,
so it should really be the same as a VT330.  (Though it differs
from a 330 in that it lacks Tektronix emulation mode.)  You should
be safe entering "DECterm" as another name for VT330.

If you need the particular escape codes, well I'm a VMS guy so I
don't have 'em in termcap format, but I could send you the SMGTERMS
definitions and you could make the translation.

