To search for a string in the headers of a post, put an h before the :, like so:
/^From:.*Serdar Argic/h:j
and to search for one in the body of the post, use an a, like so:
/My name is Dave Rhodes\./a:j

This, however, only applies to rn. You state you are running VNEWS, so it's
not too surprising that the rn killfile commands don't work; look in your
friendly neighborhood VNEWS manual for information on how to use VNEWS
killfiles.

